---
description: Repository guidance for the Mandarin active-recall service.
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` and `docs/operations.md`.

This repository owns only the active-recall HTTP service. Cloud Run service
`active-recall` and Scheduler job `daily-vocabulary` are already deployed in
GCP project `call-analyzer-512714`. Do not create a second copy.

Do not edit the desktop SQLite schema or the lesson-db migrations. The
service reads confirmed vocabulary and does not write reviews yet. Never
commit secrets, tokens, chat IDs, passwords, or password-bearing connection
strings. Keep verification offline and never call Telegram or Supabase from
tests.
